      "title": "Home | Tyler Seibert Lab for Prostate Cancer Research",
      "headings": [
        "FUNDERS"
      ],
      "text": "Welcome to the Tyler Seibert Research Laboratory University of California San Diego Identifying clinical challenges. Engineering solutions. Dr. Tyler Seibert, MD, PhD is a clinical translational scientist and leads a research team that tackles real-world clinical problems through engineering approaches. Their efforts center on three fronts: ​ 1) Develop advanced quantitative imaging biomarkers to detect cancer, guide precision therapy, and assess treatment response 2) Develop predictive genetic risk models to guide clinical decision-making 3)Design and conduct clinical trials to improve cancer treatment. ​ Dr. Seibert's lab participates in the UC San Diego Center for Multimodal Imaging and Genetics, a dynamic, interdisciplinary group of clinicians, engineers, and physicists. For Patients Projects + Publications Team Prostate Cancer Lab Research FUNDERS",
